+## Alert-path drill
+
+Prove detection reaches a human without waiting for a real outage:
+
+```bash
+ASSURANCE_DRILL=1 bash scripts/assurance/assurance.sh quick   # lane_exit=90 -> ntfy
+tail -1 /home/user/assurance/run_ledger.jsonl                  # due/trigger/exit=90
+tail -3 /home/user/alerts/alert_log.jsonl                      # delivery record
+```
+
+A drill emits the same `exit 90` record as a real failure and must produce an
+ntfy alert. Capture the ledger line and delivery log under `evidence/` for
+release evidence.
 
