+## Known gaps
+
+- The crontab schedule, thresholds and ntfy configuration live **only on the
+  host**; no committed schedule/alert-rule file exists **OBS-P1-001**. A host
+  rebuild loses alerting silently until the operator restores the crontab and
+  `NTFY_TOPIC` from their off-repo copy. This runbook documents the current
+  path so on-call can act; versioning the schedule in-repo remains open.
+- There is no committed on-call rotation artifact; escalation relies on the
+  single operator/owner.
